@startuml
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontName "Liberation Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam defaultFontStyle bold
skinparam titleFontSize 22
skinparam titleFontStyle bold

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ArrowThickness 2.0
skinparam ArrowFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowFontStyle bold

skinparam ActivityBorderColor black
skinparam ActivityBorderThickness 2.0
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam ActivityFontSize 14
skinparam ActivityFontStyle bold

title FactStamp - Module 5: Weighted Consensus & Confidence Architecture

start
:Quorum Reached in Module 4 (N >= 3 Verifications Recorded);
:Ingest Verification Vector: V = { v_1, v_2, ..., v_N };

fork
  :Component 1: Agreement Ratio (A, 40% Weight);
  :Tally Verdict Counts: { TRUE, FALSE, MISLEADING, UNVERIFIABLE };
  :Resolve Majority Verdict: V_maj = argmax(count);
  :Compute Agreement Ratio: A = (max_count / N) * 100;
  :Weighted Score A_w = 0.40 * A;
fork again
  :Component 2: Verifier Reputation (R, 30% Weight);
  :Fetch Snapshot Reputations: { r_1, r_2, ..., r_N };
  :Compute Mean Reputation: R = (1 / N) * sum(r_i);
  :Weighted Score R_w = 0.30 * R;
fork again
  :Component 3: Source Domain Quality (S, 30% Weight);
  :Parse Domain Hostnames from Evidentiary URLs;
  :Map Authority Tiers:
  - Tier 1 (Govt / WHO / Gazette): S_i = 100
  - Tier 2 (Established Press): S_i = 70
  - Tier 3 (Blogs / Unverified): S_i = 30;
  :Compute Mean Source Score: S = (1 / N) * sum(s_i);
  :Weighted Score S_w = 0.30 * S;
end fork

:Composite Confidence Calculation:
C_raw = round(A_w + R_w + S_w);
:Boundary Clamping: C = min(100, max(0, C_raw));

:Update Firestore Claim Document:
- claim.status = 'verified'
- claim.verdict = V_maj
- claim.confidenceScore = C
- claim.verifiedAt = timestamp;

:Execute Reputation Settlement Protocol:
- If verifier verdict matches V_maj: delta_R = +2
- If verifier verdict dissents from V_maj: delta_R = -1
- Clamp updated score: R_new = min(100, max(0, R_old + delta_R));

:Dispatch Real-Time Notifications to Submitter & Verifiers;
:Unlock Module 6 High-Fidelity Fact Card Generator (1080x1080 PNG);

stop

@enduml
